`fonts/PretendardVariable.woff2`

  Copyright (c) 2021, Kil Hyung-jin
  (https://github.com/orioncactus/pretendard),
  with Reserved Font Name Pretendard.

  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The full text is
  distributed with the font at `fonts/OFL.txt`.

Redistribution and web embedding are both permitted. The condition is that
`fonts/OFL.txt` travels with the font file — that is why both are listed in
`package.json`'s `files`, and why `css/fonts.css` points at the font in place
rather than inlining it.

If you remove `fonts/PretendardVariable.woff2`, remove `fonts/OFL.txt` with it.

Note the Reserved Font Name: a modified version of the font may not be
distributed under the name "Pretendard".
